{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41688","headline":"洛城见贺自真飞昇 · 陈陶","name":"洛城见贺自真飞昇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"子晋鸾飞古洛川，金桃再熟贺郎仙。\n三清乐奏嵩丘下，五色云屯御苑前。\n朱顶舞低迎绦节，青鬟歌对驻香軿。\n谁能白昼相悲泣，太极光阴亿万年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}